# Byte fidelity is the point of this release.
#
# v6 exists because encoding damage shipped silently: a UTF-8 BOM made 7 skills
# undiscoverable, and stripping a BOM from a .ps1 broke PowerShell 5.1's parse.
# Git's autocrlf would rewrite line endings on checkout, so a clone would not be
# byte-identical to the released pack and MANIFEST.json hashes would not verify.
#
# Disable all normalisation. Every file is stored and checked out exactly as
# built.
* -text
